the GNU General Public License, version 2 or any later version. It was rewritten in Rust and changed in 2026.

Translated, with their authors' notices in the files:
  src/xsha1.rs          from src/common/bnethash.cpp
  src/ladder.rs         from src/bnetd/ladder_calc.cpp

Copied:
  assets/versions.json  conf/versioncheck.json.in

Written after PvPGN's behavior, with some of its messages, defaults and small details:
  src/bncs.rs, src/hub.rs, src/command.rs, src/text.rs, src/irc.rs, src/files.rs, src/udp.rs, src/versions.rs
  mainly from src/bnetd/{handle_bnet,account,channel,command,connection,file,game,irc,message,versioncheck}.cpp

